# Normalise to LF in the repo. The POSIX shim MUST have LF endings: a CRLF
# `#!/bin/sh` line makes the kernel look for an interpreter named "sh\r" and the
# script dies with "bad interpreter". .cmd is the mirror case and wants CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
gmcp text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.jar binary
